"⟪k:6⟫直到——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_15ED5119_5FCA_49D1_BCE5_D6457583B0F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d1027f44d90ee894171dc472f9a458bf16b25f8ea0efc2ccfaa69a8382f83931
#. default-sha256: d451652052f67647e46d2e54a3084279250ae7dc99c375731a344708278d5cf5
